acceptance_criteria: "Latest pm CLI/SDK, pm-changelog, TypeScript and Node types; checkout v7; manifest and peer compatibility aligned; warning-free installed extension; real validate/import dry-run behavior tested; full release gate and package audit pass; generated dist untracked but packaged; duplicate/stale context reconciled; no secrets or private runtime data in tracked files/history."
